  <div class="card-body">
    <ul>
      <li><strong><span style="color:blue;">Blue</span></strong> — Motor and Coordination Tasks (e.g., Finger Movements, Left–Right Discrimination)</li>
      <li><strong><span style="color:gray;">Gray</span></strong> — Language and Verbal Tasks (e.g., Ambiguous Sentences, Phonological Switching)</li>
      <li><strong><span style="color:black;">Black</span></strong> — Memory and Executive Function Tasks (e.g., Time Orientation, Rapid Verbal Recall)</li>
      <li><strong><span style="color:teal;">Teal</span></strong> — Special Tasks (e.g., Lateral Preference, Catch Ball in Cup)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
